<title>BELGIUM: EU's Van Miert to propose banning Cablevision.</title>
<headline>EU's Van Miert to propose banning Cablevision.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert is to propose that the European Commission block the Cablevision Spanish cable television deal between Telefonica de Espana and Canal Plus, a European Union source said.</p>
<p>&quot;He will propose to his colleagues to ban the merger&quot; the source said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
